  "description": "TokenFlow.AI — A lightweight .NET library for tokenization, chunking, and cost estimation across modern LLMs\n      (OpenAI GPT-4o, Claude, Azure OpenAI).\n\n      v0.7.0 introduces:\n      • CLI v3.0 alignment with unified cost analysis commands\n      • Flow.AI.Core model registry integration\n      • Dynamic cost estimation with fallback handling\n      • Optional benchmark regression tracking in CI/CD\n\n      Part of the Flow.AI ecosystem — the engine powering PromptStream.AI and related frameworks.",
